<div data-controller="walk-start">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4">
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-8">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-56 md:max-w-64">
          <%= image_tag "citytori-start.png", class: "w-full" %>
        </div>

        <h2 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">
          しりとり散歩を始めよう
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
          街を歩いて、言葉を見つけてみよう！
        </p>

        <%= button_tag "始める", type: "button", class: "rounded-md bg-blue-600 px-10 py-3 text-lg text-white", data: { action: "walk-start#open"} %>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-2 text-s text-slate-600">
        ※「始める」を押すと位置情報を利用できるか確認します
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <dialog
    data-walk-start-target="modal"
    class="
      fixed inset-0 size-auto max-h-none max-w-none bg-transparent p-0
      backdrop:bg-black/70
    "
  >
    <div class="flex min-h-full items-center justify-center p-4">
      <div class="relative w-full max-w-lg rounded-lg bg-white p-6 shadow-xl">
        <button
          type="button"
          data-action="walk-start#close"
          aria-label="閉じる"
          class="absolute right-4 top-4 text-xl text-gray-500"
        >
          ×
        </button>

        <div class="mt-4">
          <%= button_to "散歩を始める",
                        word_chain_walks_path,
                        method: :post,
                        class: "rounded-md bg-blue-600 px-10 py-3 text-lg text-white" %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </dialog>
</div>
